! FAIL.DBG - debugger commands for FAILDBG, FAILMAIN and FAILSUB built
! /DEBUG and linked /DEBUG (docs/PHASE-41.md, subtask 1): the access
! violation two calls deep, as the debugger reports it, and the call
! chain there (Decision 6).
!
SET MODULE/ALL
SHOW MODULE
GO
SHOW CALLS
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION .PC
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION SUB2:FAILSUB\%LINE 13
EXAMINE/INSTRUCTION FAILMAIN:FAILMAIN+10
EXAMINE R2
SHOW CALLS 1
